abstract: >-
  Automated daily monitoring of arXiv preprints for materials science:
  a scheduled GitHub Action that queries selected arXiv categories with
  boolean keyword logic, generates concise AI summaries of the matching
  papers with OpenAI language models, and delivers the digest as a text
  report or email notification. Keeps literature screening reproducible
  and configuration-driven, with zero infrastructure beyond the
  repository itself.
  Funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG, German Research
  Foundation) under the National Research Data Infrastructure –
  NFDI 38/1 – project number 460247524 (NFDI-MatWerk consortium).
